{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tragedy has befallen Ambyth, and you\u2019re the town\u2019s only hope! In Tempered Hue you\u2019ll run the local Blacksmith\u2019s Shop and mine for rare resources, all while building relationships, tackling enemies, and scaling the vast caverns of the town\u2019 s towering escarpment. Find survivors, restore Ambyth, and root out the source of a looming curse. Your time has come, apprentice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Blacksmith\u2019s Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town\u2019s only blacksmith, locals and visitors alike will come to you in search of common goods and unique gifts. Forge a variety of items in your workshop, then use them to earn coin in your shopfront, or deliver orders to your neighbours, to strengthen bonds and unlock new recipes and questlines. Riches await those who devote themselves to a shopkeep\u2019s life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cavern Delving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To craft anything, you\u2019ll need to travel into the caverns of the nearby escarpment. Explore its unique environments to mine and forage, with various metals, flora, and fauna awaiting discovery. Upgrade your tools to gather higher tier resources, and scale the heights of the caverns to find unique items, lost townsfolk, and uncover mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forging Friendships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Ambyth in disarray, its townsfolk need your help. Finding survivors will unlock new questlines, and deeper connections can unlock new recipes and bonuses when like becomes love. Be aware, however, that connections existed before you in Ambyth. A friendship with one person could find you at odds with another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visiting Towns (Multiplayer)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome up to three friends to your version of Ambyth, or sail to visit theirs. The escarpment\u2019s layouts are unique to each player\u2019s game, so your friend\u2019s caves will differ greatly from your own. Share discoveries and build memories beyond the main storyline: encounter new \u2018townsfolk\u2019, find rare recipes, and spend big at your friends\u2019 blacksmith shops (or make a hearty profit). Adventures are best enjoyed with company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917600?t=1755246004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/b937d4abcd2e9b4d8aef82c04371ee27f0de23c7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755246004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/37e0703d9c8052966104f82a2685e717021c6c3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755246004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/37e0703d9c8052966104f82a2685e717021c6c3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755246004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tragedy has befallen Ambyth, and you\u2019re the town\u2019s only hope! In Tempered Hue you\u2019ll run the local Blacksmith\u2019s Shop and mine for rare resources, all while building relationships, tackling enemies, and scaling the vast caverns of the town\u2019 s towering escarpment. Find survivors, restore Ambyth, and root out the source of a looming curse. Your time has come, apprentice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Blacksmith\u2019s Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/cbea0ed0799163778dc2be5ed6d0ccad.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the town\u2019s only blacksmith, locals and visitors alike will come to you in search of common goods and unique gifts. Forge a variety of items in your workshop, then use them to earn coin in your shopfront, or deliver orders to your neighbours, to strengthen bonds and unlock new recipes and questlines. Riches await those who devote themselves to a shopkeep\u2019s life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cavern Delving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/849888be1d9a24969308317254ddc1a2.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To craft anything, you\u2019ll need to travel into the caverns of the nearby escarpment. Explore its unique environments to mine and forage, with various metals, flora, and fauna awaiting discovery. Upgrade your tools to gather higher tier resources, and scale the heights of the caverns to find unique items, lost townsfolk, and uncover mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forging Friendships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/b4b5d9b22c7b129fd89f23f0e844b929.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Ambyth in disarray, its townsfolk need your help. Finding survivors will unlock new questlines, and deeper connections can unlock new recipes and bonuses when like becomes love. Be aware, however, that connections existed before you in Ambyth. A friendship with one person could find you at odds with another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visiting Towns (Multiplayer)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.poster.avif?t=1755246004\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.webm?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/extras/11227d7dddb6f7dcdc9f502afa56a105.mp4?t=1755246004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome up to three friends to your version of Ambyth, or sail to visit theirs. The escarpment\u2019s layouts are unique to each player\u2019s game, so your friend\u2019s caves will differ greatly from your own. Share discoveries and build memories beyond the main storyline: encounter new \u2018townsfolk\u2019, find rare recipes, and spend big at your friends\u2019 blacksmith shops (or make a hearty profit). Adventures are best enjoyed with company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Zugalu Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917600/978e88f605c9b9db43ab441a689ef7fb13a264c8/header.jpg?t=1755246004","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Zugalu Ltd.. All rights reserved. Sovereign Syndicate is a registered trademark of Crimson Herring Studios Inc.","linux_requirements":[